---
import PolicyPage from '@/components/PolicyPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
---

<PolicyPage title="Privacy Policy" description="What personal information Jhumka collects, why, and how it is kept.">
  <p>{SITE.name} collects only what it needs to take your order, deliver it, and help you afterwards.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>When you order:</strong> your name, mobile number, email address (if you give one), delivery address and any note you add.</li>
    <li><strong>When you pay:</strong> Razorpay handles the payment. We receive a payment reference and the method used — never your card number, UPI PIN or bank login.</li>
    <li><strong>When you review a piece:</strong> the rating, text, display name and any photographs you upload. Photographs are re-saved on our server, which removes camera metadata such as location.</li>
    <li><strong>Automatically:</strong> basic technical information such as your IP address, kept briefly to keep the site secure and to limit abuse.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do with it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Process, pack, ship and track your order.</li>
    <li>Answer your questions and handle returns or refunds.</li>
    <li>Show published reviews next to the piece you bought.</li>
    <li>Keep the invoices and records the law requires us to keep.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not send marketing messages unless you ask us to.</p>

  <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Razorpay</strong> — to take payments and issue refunds.</li>
    <li><strong>Courier partners</strong> — your name, address and phone number, so they can deliver.</li>
    <li><strong>Our hosting provider</strong> — the website and database run on a private server we control.</li>
    <li><strong>Authorities</strong> — only where the law requires it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Order records and invoices are kept for as long as tax and accounting rules require. Reviews stay published until you ask us to remove them.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and similar storage</h2>
  <p>Your bag is stored in your own browser so it survives a refresh. We use no advertising or tracking cookies. Razorpay sets its own cookies during payment; see Razorpay's privacy policy.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us for a copy of what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it where we are not required to keep it. Write to the contact details below and we will reply within <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: 30 days]</span>.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This shop is meant for adults. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the updated version appears on this page with a new date at the top.</p>
</PolicyPage>
